133
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:32,260
Quê?

134
00:09:37,980 --> 00:09:41,097
Ah, meu Deus. Lá vamos nós.

135
00:09:57,300 --> 00:10:00,212
Ah, meu Deus.

136
