194
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:15,368
Merda.

195
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:18,851
Sua vez, Heather.

196
00:14:24,380 --> 00:14:26,336
Fácil, Heather.

197
00:14:26,336 --> 00:14:28,536
Quem não arrisca, não petisca.

198
